{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in an maze of rustling stalks, you must find the way out before something in the corn finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hour a new seed generates a fresh field with different landmarks, props and exit locations. Make noise and the stalker will home in; stay quiet, read the signs, and slip past it alive.<br><br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different cornfield every hour (no two runs alike)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, props and landmarks change the feel of each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound-driven Props: crows, running and traps all attract the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, tense atmosphere, short sessions designed for replay<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781280/extras/1ad761c511980d9a6138aa0e8b852107.avif?t=1759930234\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781280?t=1759930234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781280/46d27478710a3b67d730fc4f08bc1fd33fde1126/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759930234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781280/279c7891bd2fe297ef2ea09dd241383f08811297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759930234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781280/279c7891bd2fe297ef2ea09dd241383f08811297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759930234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in an maze of rustling stalks, you must find the way out before something in the corn finds you.<